  "title": "· In View · Louis Vuitton Releases New Edition of REBONDS Photobook: A Shared Vision for Protecting Children",
  "original_title": "视野 | Louis Vuitton 发布新版《REBONDS》摄影集：助力守护儿童的共同愿景",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton marks its 10-year UNICEF partnership with a new football-themed *REBONDS* photobook featuring 100 creatives.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-07-02",
  "date_label": "July 02, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/ad08pbr/1106216abb4b1b1a.jpg",
