      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The reissued *REBONDS* photobook carries forward the spirit of the original edition while staying true to the mission of the Louis Vuitton–UNICEF partnership: all proceeds will be donated to UNICEF to support its vital work for children in need around the world. The new book has been available at Louis Vuitton stores globally since June, priced at ¥1,200.",
